{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ddi-api-collection-001",
    "name": "DDI API",
    "description": "REST API collection for the DDI Spring Boot application. This API manages Schools, Students, and Subjects with full CRUD operations and relationship management.\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:8080`\n\n## Resources\n- **Schools**: Manage educational institutions (1:N relationship with Students)\n- **Students**: Manage student records (N:1 with School, N:M with Subjects)\n- **Subjects**: Manage academic subjects (N:M relationship with Students)\n\n## Database\nMySQL database on port 3300",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
