            "description": "Updates an existing school.\n\n**Path Parameters**:\n- `id` (Long): The unique identifier of the school\n\n**Request Body**:\n```json\n{\n    \"name\": \"string\" // Updated name of the school\n}\n```\n\n**Response Codes**:\n- `200 OK`: School updated successfully\n- `404 Not Found`: School does not exist"
          },
          "response": []
