                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "School ID"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Deletes a school by its ID.\n\n**Path Parameters**:\n- `id` (Long): The unique identifier of the school\n\n**Response Codes**:\n- `204 No Content`: School deleted successfully\n- `404 Not Found`: School does not exist\n\n**Note**: Due to cascade settings, deleting a school will also delete all associated students."
